OL,3,GNEWSAStaff lacked necessary safety
OL,4,Atraining, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former head of department at Island
OL,7,FEnergy handed in his notice in the year
OL,8,Fof an explosion because no workers had
OL,9,Fup-to-date safe control of operations
OL,10,Ftraining (SCO), Jersey's Royal Court
OL,11,Fhas heard.
OL,13,FJames Cherry was off-island when an
OL,14,Fexplosion occurred at Haut du Mont on
OL,15,F10 December 2022, killing 10 people.
