OL,3,GNEWSAStaff lacked necessary safety
OL,4,Atraining, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe residents who died as a result were
OL,7,FPeter Bowler, 72, Billy Marsden, 62,
OL,8,FDerek Ellis, 61, Sylvia Ellis, 73, Ken
OL,9,FRalph, 72, Jane Ralph, 71, Romeu De
OL,10,FAlmeida, 67, Louise De Almeida, 64,
OL,11,FRaymond Brown, 71, and Kathy McGinness,
OL,12,F73.
OL,14,FGas workers Neil Armstrong, John Wright
OL,15,Fand Lee Ward deny 10 counts of gross
OL,16,Fnegligence manslaughter. Island Energy
OL,17,Fhas pleaded not guilty in a combined
OL,18,Fhealth and safety case.
